TYPES.md §16 (log-2026-09-28 "check follow-ups 4 round 3"): a deprecated entry of the studio's
`units` table used by `unit:` warns, bare or as a string; an unknown one is views' E1610, silent
here.
-- studio/studio.canon --
package studio

/// A unit.
record UnitSpec {
  /// Its suffix.
  suffix: String = ""
}

/// The units.
let units: table UnitSpec = {
  hp @deprecated("use kg") { suffix: " HP" }
  kg { suffix: " kg" }
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A gem.
record Gem {
  /// Its weight.
  weight: Int
  /// Its mass.
  mass: Int
  /// Its capacity.
  capacity: Int
}

view Gem {
  weight { unit: hp }
  mass { unit: "hp" }
  capacity { unit: kg }
}
-- findings.txt --
warning[W3301]  a/a.canon:14:18
  hp is deprecated: use kg

warning[W3301]  a/a.canon:15:16
  hp is deprecated: use kg

0 errors, 2 warnings in 2 packages (…)
